      "sourceTextSha256": "51af55dcc3f1a33c5cee31b4d481b5b0436a1e3f7be3727b41cfc9cec346cfec",
      "text": "Day 9 · Breakfast at the hotel. Transfer and flight from Santiago to Calama, then by road to the Bolivian border at Hito Cajón, where your journey into the Altiplano begins: the striking Laguna Verde beneath the Licancabur volcano, the surreal Stone Tree standing alone in the desert, and the Polques hot springs, where you can enjoy a steaming thermal bath.\n\nContinue to the Sol de Mañana geysers, with jets of boiling steam and pools of bubbling mud, through the Dalí Desert and its bizarre stone shapes, to the spectacular Laguna Colorada, home to many flamingos. Arrival at Ojo de Perdiz; overnight at a desert hotel (box lunch and dinner).",
      "provenance": {
        "kind": "word_exact",
        "fileId": "1X7vYrKfJejOIcKnAqLzOpNNqMi_FS0Mx",
        "documentSha256": "d6a0fea61270c4c20d307d3029b9c8fc090134a96b082cedfc3ed496b503946f",
