    {
      "blockId": "tour:itinerary_text:d1bf136a4a3c936a",
      "field": "itinerary.text",
      "sourceTextSha256": "d7bc7cd294a4cd9098141e11fa084c5bff7325f940250372eac36dfe267e150f",
      "text": "Day 10 · A day of colour among the Joyas Altoandinas, high-altitude lagoons such as Chiarkota and Cañapa, whose hues come from minerals and algae, with pink and white flamingos. Then cross the legendary Uyuni Salt Flats by jeep, where land and sky blend into one endless horizon, and continue to Incahuasi Island and its giant cacti; hike to the top for a 360° view over the salt flat. Overnight in Uyuni.",
